 month_sales_volume_max? Optional: filter products with monthly sales volume less than or\n   *                                equal to this value.\n   * @param delivery_type? Optional: filter products by fulfillment method. Allowed values: `Both`\n   *                       (default, no filter), `FBM` (seller-fulfilled), `FBA` (any product using\n   *                       Amazon FBA, including seller-shipped and third-party like 1688), `AmzFBA`\n   *                       (third-party seller using Amazon FBA, e.g. 1688).\n   * @param page? The page index of the query result. Defaults to page 1. Each page returns 20 records.\n   * @param amz_site? Amazon marketplace site.\n   */\n  function potential_product(search_name?: string, price_min?: number, price_max?: number, month_sales_volume_min?: number, month_sales_volume_max?: number);\n  // optional (3): delivery_type, page, amz_site\n\n  /**\n   * Query TikTok platform product trend, returning multiple dimensions: sales, price, star rating,\n   * review count, new promo video count, new promo author count.\n   *\n   * @param product_id Product ID.\n   * @param site? TikTok site.\n   */\n  function tiktok_product_trend(product_id: string, site?: \"Unknow\" | \"US\" | \"MY\" | \"PH\" | \"VN\" | \"TH\" | \"ID\" | \"GB\" | \"JP\");\n\n  /**\n   * Search product information on the 1688 platform across multiple dimensions.\n   *\n   * @param node_id? Query based on a category (not limited to leaf categories); if specified, search\n   *                 within that category.\n   * @param supplier_name? Fuzzy-match products by supplier name.\n   * @param supplier_type? Filter by supplier type, single choice. 1: Powerful merchant, 2: Super\n   *                       factory.\n   * @param supplier_member_type? Filter by supplier member type, single choice. 1: Deep certified, 2:\n   *                              Non-deep certified.\n   * @param rights? Filter by rights/benefits. Multiple choice, comma-separated, e.g. \"1,2,3\". 1: 7-day\n   *                free return, 2: free shipping insurance, 3: ship within 48 hours.\n   * @param dropshipping_price_range_min? Filter products with selling price greater than or equal to\n   *                                      this value.\n   * @param dropshipping_price_range_max? Filter products with selling price less than or equal to this\n   *                                      value.\n   * @param cumulative_sale_count_min? Filter products with cumulative sales volume greater than or equal\n   *                                   to this value.\n   * @param cumulative_sale_count_max? Filter products with cumulative sales volume less than or equal to\n   *                                   this value.\n   * @param recent_30_day_sale_min? Filter products with sales quantity in the last 30 days greater than\n   *                                or equal to this value.\n   * @param recent_30_day_sale_max? Filter products with sales quantity in the last 30 days less than or\n   *                                equal to this value.\n   * @param repurchase_rate_min? Filter products with repurchase rate greater than or equal to this\n   *                             value.\n   * @param repurchase_rate_max? Filter products with repurchase rate less than or equal to this value.\n   * @param service_score_min? Filter products with overall service score greater than or equal to this\n   *                           value.\n   * @param service_score_max? Filter products with overall service score less than or equal to this\n   *                           value.\n   * @param sku_count_min? Filter products with SKU count greater than or equal to this value.\n   * @param sku_count_max? Filter products with SKU count less than or equal to this value.\n   * @param stock_count_min? Filter products with stock count greater than or equal to this value.\n   * @param stock_count_max? Filter products with stock count less than or equal to this value.\n   * @param onl